>A Sorted Table</SectionComponent>
<p>The native Freon <code>Table</code> takes a list of nodes of the same type and displays their properties in columns or rows. But what if you want something different? In this example we sort a schedule’s list of time slots by their <code>TimeStamp</code> (day/part) <em>before</em> displaying the schedule.</p>
<p>As a reminder, here are the AST definitions of <code>Schedule</code>, <code>Slot</code> and <code>TimeStamp</code>.</p>
<pre class="language-ts"><code class="language-ts">// CourseSchedule/phase5/defs/main.ast#L10-L14

