<h3 id="the-html-section-2">The HTML Section</h3>
<p>We couldn’t use the <code>Table</code> component from the library because it clips its content (including dropdowns). With a bit of CSS we recreated a table in plain HTML.</p>
<p>First, the headers: each holds a day name. Because we also display row headers (<code>Morning</code> and <code>Afternoon</code>), the first header cell is empty.</p>
<pre class="language-svelte"><code class="language-svelte">// CourseSchedule/phase5/src/external/Schedule.svelte#L193-L203

